{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3239","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3239","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3239\",\"parent_revision\":\"2140a07b115574a18251acc3752b96bac94f673deb522c22b12fd66b41090523\",\"root_revision\":\"2140a07b115574a18251acc3752b96bac94f673deb522c22b12fd66b41090523\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nDiscovered while addressing PR #3238. `docs/workflow-layers/COVERAGE.md` makes G2 re-extraction mandatory and forbids manually patching derived layer/graph outputs.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Problem\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nThe workflow-layer coverage contract requires re-extracting `G2-artifacts.json` whenever an artifact-producing skill changes. PR #3238 corrected `skills/code-review-architecture/SKILL.md`, but the documented `dh:workflow-extractor` is retired, so the G2 record and its derived graph cannot be regenerated through a supported path.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Required Outcome\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n1. Restore or replace the supported G2 extraction path from the shipped skill source.\\n2. Regenerate `docs/workflow-layers/G2-artifacts.json` from that path; do not hand-edit it.\\n3. Run `uv run plugins/development-harness/docs/assemble_graph.py` to regenerate `docs/dh-workflow-graph.json` and embedded explorer data.\\n4. Add a repeatable check proving a changed artifact-producing skill cannot leave its required layer stale.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"d0925df6b0918b0522fcd67143430d1b06db9c904f58dd0aaf0007a794b62f7c\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABRL5yyA\"}"}